OL,3,GNEWSARoad opens three years after being
OL,4,Acompleted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new road linking the eastern and
OL,7,Fwestern sides of a Dorset town has
OL,8,Fopened three years after construction
OL,9,Fwas completed.
OL,11,FThe road in Gillingham is called
OL,12,FMadjeston Way, the name put forward by
OL,13,Fthe town council, and spans just under
OL,14,Fone mile (1.3km).
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
