OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARoad opens three years after being
OL,4,Acompleted
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Council said the route,
OL,7,Finformally known as Kiln Way during the
OL,8,Fdevelopment phase, formed a key part of
OL,9,Fthe town's southern expansion. It said
OL,10,Fthe road would give residents and
OL,11,Fvisitors an alternative route across
OL,12,Fthe town, helping to ease pressure on
OL,13,Fexisting roads.
OL,15,FAlthough construction of the road
OL,16,Ffinished in 2023, linking New Road with
OL,17,FShaftesbury Road, it remained closed
OL,18,Fwhile the surrounding housing
OL,19,Fdevelopment progressed.
